expect: written
why: the fact is about accounts and not about this code, and a one-line body shows no reason for dropping the rest of the entry type, so the presence form keeps it; the written form is two plain sentences, the second naming this code's element
labelled: 2026-09-20
--- code
export function postingTypeOf(requirement: SettlementRequirement): string {
  return requirement.entryType.split(';')[0];
}
--- facts
An account can refuse a posting, so a full entry type would hide the clearing house's answer.
